[component]
name: Main Program
category: Functions
description: Steps that run only when this file is started directly.

[interaction]
help The steps inside run when the program starts (if __name__ == "__main__").
check call | Call a main function | 0
text func | Function to call | main

[template]
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> Main Program
if __name__ == "__main__":
<PWCT:IF> <call>
    <func|ident>()
<PWCT:ENDIF>
